    "faqPaymentMethodsAnswer": "We offer cash on delivery, Vodafone Cash, InstaPay, and credit cards.",
    "faqDeliveryTime": "How long does delivery take?",
    "faqDeliveryTimeAnswer": "Delivery takes 2-5 business days depending on your location. Prime service offers next-day delivery.",
    "faqReturnPolicy": "What is the return policy?",
    "faqReturnPolicyAnswer": "You can return the product within 14 days of receipt in its original condition with the invoice.",
    "faqOriginalProducts": "Are the products original?",
    "faqOriginalProductsAnswer": "Yes, all our products are 100% original and guaranteed by certified sellers.",
    "faqBecomeSeller": "How do I become a seller?",
    "faqBecomeSellerAnswer": "You can register as a seller through the \"Sell on Shoporia\" page and create your store for free."
